# ============================================================
# Transparency doctrine (2026-06-11): this repo is a gift to the
# Kryptos community. Everything authored here is tracked and pushed
# to GitHub, with exactly four classes of exceptions:
#
#   1. .claude/        — Claude Code agent + skill definitions
#                        (the precise construction of agents/skills
#                        stays private; the kryptosbot code itself
#                        is public)
#   2. Secrets         — .env files and keys, never tracked
#   3. Machine outputs — run results, caches, build output, venvs,
#                        logs; regenerable, no community value
#   4. reference/ + archive/ + analysis_runs/ — third-party source
#                        material (some copyrighted), bulk personal
#                        research archives, and photo corpora. The
#                        only photos shared are the ones live on
#                        kryptosbot.com.
# ============================================================

# --- 1. Private agent/skill construction ---------------------
.claude/

# --- 2. Secrets ----------------------------------------------
.env

# --- 3. Machine outputs --------------------------------------
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.so
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Logs / scratch
*.log
logs/
agent_logs
work
tmp
nohup.out
scratch/
.remember/
.worktrees/

# Run outputs and caches (20+ GB; regenerable; summaries live in docs/)
db
results/
artifacts
checkpoints/
jobs/done/
*.jsonl
# bench suites are authored test fixtures, not run output
!bench/**/*.jsonl
kryptosbot_results.db
kryptosbot/kbot_results/
kryptosbot/split_results/
kryptosbot/kryptosbot_results.db
kryptosbot/english_quadgrams.txt
kryptosbot.tar.gz
data/experiment_ledger.*
data/experiment_prose_backfill.json
agent_analysis.json
bootstrap_report.json
framework_inventory.json
manifest.json
/synth_signal/

# Phase 6 null-baseline manifest is committed (small summary file);
# the large per-distribution cache lives under results/ (ignored above).
!null_baselines/manifest.json

# Site build output (regenerable via ops/site_builder/build.py;
# also holds the GoAccess stats report, which is not repo content)
site/
site.stale-*/

# Coverage artifacts
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# --- 4. Reference material, archives, photo corpora ----------
# Third-party sources (books, scans, NSA docs — some copyrighted),
# AAA archive photo corpus, and bulk community-thread archives.
# Photos shared with the community are the ones on kryptosbot.com.
reference/
archive/
analysis_runs/
external/
wordlists/kaikki_english.txt

# --- Deliberately withheld -----------------------------------
